em", "numeric-id": 85, "id": "Q85"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16906$ADE47EFF-85D6-48E7-A39C-5D7A279F1982", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "56a36472bf138ad657bcd00b39a227efdeb13c86", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 85, "id": "Q85"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16906$F1D843F0-780C-482D-B454-71CCABC5B81E", "rank": "normal"}], "P19": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P19", "hash": "e7e57797f6542e9c9712d907d4e7289d1a4f658d", "datavalue": {"value": "Carmen McRae. Everybody had it that I had taken her song and that she was supposed to be mad at me, which she was not, not at all. At the end, I was there. I went to the house, tried to get her to play pinochle. She was a lot of fun. I loved her a lot. Like I felt about Sarah. I was to go see Sarah that same week that she passed, and they said when I - they called me to tell me not to come, bec...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16906$C3EBD08E-9FE9-4091-A2D3-08EC8B6E058B", "rank": "normal"}]}}